OL,3,GNEWSASeahorse habitats 'healing' thanks
OL,4,Ato eco-moorings
OL,5,
OL,6,FScars caused to rare seahorse habitats
OL,7,Fby boat anchors off the Dorset coast
OL,8,Fare starting to heal, thanks to the
OL,9,Finstallation of new moorings.
OL,11,FIn 2021, Studland Bay Marine
OL,12,FPartnership began installing the first
OL,13,Fof dozens of eco-moorings in a bid to
OL,14,Freverse damage to delicate seagrass
OL,15,Fmeadows.
OL,17,FA new scientific study has now provided
OL,18,Fthe first evidence that eco-moorings
OL,19,Fcan help restore seagrass, with some
OL,20,Fscars shrinking by more than 90% over
OL,21,Ffour years.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
